// Optional keyboard overrides. Each entry is "<feature or command id>": "<chord>[, <chord>...]".
// Chords: letters / digits, F1..F25, Space, Tab, Esc, Enter, ~, + - , . Up Down Left Right,
// NumN / Num+ / Num-, with Ctrl+ / Shift+ / Alt+ prefixes. An empty string unbinds.
// Every id is listed in the F1 panel (hover a row) and in the Ctrl+K palette.
//
// Defaults shipped with the app (already active, listed here for reference):
//   pause Space · speed.up + · speed.down - · time.reverse , · time.forward .
//   focus.sun 0 · focus.1..8 1..8 · orbits O · labels L · trails T · realscale R
//   settings F1 · language F2 · bookmarks F3 · record F9 · profiler F10 · screenshot F12
//   help Tab · hud ~ · palette Ctrl+K · search Ctrl+F · seek J · fullscreen Alt+Enter
//   bookmark.next Ctrl+E · bookmark.prev Ctrl+Shift+E
//   waypoint.1..9 Ctrl+1..9 · waypoint.clear.1..9 Ctrl+Shift+1..9 · path.play Shift+P · path.clear Ctrl+Shift+P
//
// Everything else (axes, dwarfs, probes, lagrange, constellations, tidal, alignment, meteors,
// lighttime, simmode, physics.g, physics.sunmass, physics.exponent, physics.lightspeed, physics.hud,
// physics.collisions, physics.resetconst, physics.reinit, physics.resetmasses, mass.<body>, solarwind, solarflares,
// corona, aurora, atmosphere, eclipses, pbr, oceanmask, bloom, autoexposure, fxaa, lensflare,
// toolbar, timeline, audio, hotreload, gpubelt, quit) has no default key: use the F1 panel or
// Ctrl+K, or bind it here. A key on "simmode" cycles Ephemeris -> Physics -> Compare; a key on a
// slider (physics.g, mass.earth, ...) resets it to its default.
//
// To restore the pre-2026 single-letter layout, uncomment the block below.
